 " gives."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"42f03996-f619-4d01-923a-8a9292301ba9"],

Cell["\<\
When the pairing on cohomology is perfect, a twist exists exactly when the \
space is of Hodge type, since any harmonic subspace then extends to a Hodge \
decomposition (arXiv:2004.07362, Remark 3.13).\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a87f2c0b-3f7b-4426-b84a-e35106c9e35f"],

